title Job Application Submission - All Patterns Working Together

actor "Job Seeker" as seeker
participant "Application\nController" as controller
participant "Application\nDraftManager" as memento
participant "Submit\nCommand" as command
participant "Command\nInvoker" as invoker
participant "Application\nStatusSubject" as subject
participant "Email\nObserver" as email
participant "Dashboard\nObserver" as dashboard
participant "Comprehensive\nScoringStrategy" as strategy
database "Repository" as repo

seeker -> controller : Apply(jobPostingId, coverLetter)
activate controller

controller -> memento : GetDraft(jobSeekerId, jobPostingId)
note right: **Memento Pattern**\nLoad auto-saved draft
memento --> controller : draft (if exists)

controller -> command : new SubmitApplicationCommand(application)
note right: **Command Pattern**\nEncapsulate request

controller -> invoker : ExecuteAsync(command)
activate invoker

invoker -> command : ExecuteAsync()
activate command

command -> repo : UpdateAsync(application)
note right: Change status to Submitted
repo --> command : success

command --> invoker : success
invoker -> invoker : Push to undo stack
note right: Enable undo functionality
deactivate command

invoker --> controller : success
deactivate invoker

controller -> subject : NotifyAsync(application)
note right: **Observer Pattern**\nNotify all observers
activate subject

subject -> email : UpdateAsync(application)
activate email
email -> email : Send email to employer
email --> subject : done
deactivate email

subject -> dashboard : UpdateAsync(application)
activate dashboard
dashboard -> dashboard : Add notification
dashboard --> subject : done
deactivate dashboard

subject --> controller : done
deactivate subject

controller -> memento : DeleteDraft(jobSeekerId, jobPostingId)
note right: **Memento Pattern**\nClean up draft after submission
memento --> controller : deleted

controller --> seeker : Application submitted successfully

note over seeker, repo
  **Employer Views Applications**
  Uses **Strategy Pattern** to rank applicants
  Uses **Iterator Pattern** to filter/paginate
end note

